{"id":"c75bb5270ee96d5a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-logical-consequence.md","title":"Logical Consequence","display":"df-logical-consequence — Logical Consequence","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-logical-consequence","aliases":["92-df-logical-consequence"],"display":"df-logical-consequence — Logical Consequence","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-model]]","[[92-df-assignment]]","[[92-df-interpretation]]","[[92-df-universal-closure]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]"],"source":"本地一阶模型论背景；第 X 章 pp. 112–113 区分可证性与标准真","source_status":"原书相关背景的本地定义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-logical-consequence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-logical-consequence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-logical-consequence — Logical Consequence"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"302b3328b775d21b\" href=\"?note=302b3328b775d21b\" title=\"92-df-universal-closure\">92-df-universal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地一阶模型论背景；第 X 章 pp. 112–113 区分可证性与标准真"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书相关背景的本地定义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence-set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struc}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\)</span> (structure class, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fd60117fc80e6f95\" href=\"?note=fd60117fc80e6f95\" title=\"92-df-model\">92-df-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}_G\\)</span> (assignment constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fdcbc43c728f79fc\" href=\"?note=fdcbc43c728f79fc\" title=\"92-df-assignment\">92-df-assignment</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_G\">\\(\\models_G\\)</span> (satisfaction relation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"2b7f27c890af1dc3\" href=\"?note=2b7f27c890af1dc3\" title=\"92-df-interpretation\">92-df-interpretation</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\Phi \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>的逻辑后承</li>\n<li>在所有满足<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\">\\(\\Phi\\)</span>的结构中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>也成立</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi = \\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\">\\(\\Phi = \\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\\)</span>，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)] \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)] \\models \\varphi\\)</span>即<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>的公理模型中真</li>\n<li>对采用标准可靠一阶演算的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(G\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>蕴含<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\\models_G\\varphi\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\\models_G\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>对采用标准完备一阶演算并把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\">\\(\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\\)</span>作为非逻辑公理的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，一阶完备性给出反向蕴涵；这里的“完备性”是演算相对于所有模型的完备性</li>\n<li>算术不完备比较的是特定理论的可证性与标准模型真理，不与一阶逻辑的语义后承完备性冲突</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-universal-closure","status":"resolved","id":"302b3328b775d21b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-universal-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"fd60117fc80e6f95","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struc}_G$ (structure class, see [[92-df-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"fdcbc43c728f79fc","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Assign}_G$ (assignment constructor, see [[92-df-assignment]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"2b7f27c890af1dc3","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models_G$ (satisfaction relation, see [[92-df-interpretation]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Phi \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struc}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assign}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}logical\\text{-}consequence} \\vdash\n\\Phi\\models_G\\varphi\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Struc}_G\\,\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assign}_G(|\\mathfrak M|)\\;\n\\Bigl((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;(\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\psi))\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathfrak M,\\beta\\models_G\\varphi\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi = \\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)] \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]\\models_G\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UCl}_G[\\mathrm{Ax}(G)]","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1936,"backlinks":[{"id":"668e712bdadc015a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\models_G$ (logical consequence, see [[92-df-logical-consequence]])"},{"id":"29a0403e0c65ae9d","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bf5133176eaa12c8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-consequence]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-95","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-logical-consequence]]"}],"outgoing":["90f32e29c9d553ed","fd60117fc80e6f95","fdcbc43c728f79fc","2b7f27c890af1dc3","302b3328b775d21b","35c764f4e9f21f28"]}